  "ingredients": [
    "6 Hawaiian bread rolls (such as King's®)",
    "0.5 cup shredded Swiss cheese, divided",
    "0.5 cup shredded Cheddar cheese, divided",
    "3 slices cooked bacon, diced, divided",
    "4 green onions, diced, divided",
    "3 eggs",
    "0.66666668653488 cup half-and-half",
    "0.5 cup skim milk",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "2 tablespoons grated Parmesan cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B0X_L13J9-MNOqW3f33CWZ_18NE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/261055-sweet-bread-strata-VAT-005-step-01-f0d8bc881d684289939ea9d4ddeaac6d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261055/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut each roll into 8 cubes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4uuZqiBZBwon70OAikHpWv1OYAo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/261055-sweet-bread-strata-VAT-006-step-02-d29c86a1b1e4430699710b3d6807643b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261055/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread onto a baking sheet in a single layer. Bake in the preheated oven until toasted, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/2KUNK_BTHa9TEKMwImCs3SiS01A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/261055-sweet-bread-strata-VAT-007-step-03-6ef0f64537134d8db9a59dbc33e01e7c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261055/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Layer toasted bread cubes in a 1 1/2-quart baking pan. Sprinkle 1/4 cup Swiss cheese, 1/4 cup Cheddar cheese, 1/2 the bacon, and 2 green onions on top of the bread. Shake to settle the toppings into the bread.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fA-oHMoo_usLkOtIk4k3U_Sp25A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/261055-sweet-bread-strata-VAT-008-step-04-edf4958170b64389bf140e0254bcd24b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261055/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat eggs together with half-and-half, milk, salt, and pepper in a bowl. Pour over the bread cubes, pressing cubes down into the mixture.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rk09hXbnTCdRDidlHoC8ewcP-IY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/261055-sweet-bread-strata-VAT-009-step-05-700f2b6f747c4691b976dd4dd63daf31.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261055/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle the remaining Swiss cheese, Cheddar cheese, bacon, green onions, and Parmesan cheese on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/KG925CnGJPdDC5cYha9dxcxLRzg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/261055-sweet-bread-strata-VAT-010-step-06-cec6c6018e494de890e08c8db97b0a2c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/261055/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until strata is hot in the center, about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lVG_nrtGLnLcYsHoQ10gfdnjco4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/261055-sweet-bread-strata-VAT-011-step-07-251a5d6d7630475388cd387dd3064a17.jpg"
